{"id":"53f0f7e6a055d365","group":"93","path":"93/93-fact-polynomial-complete.md","title":"Polynomial Complete","display":"Polynomial Complete","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-fact-polynomial-complete","aliases":["93-fact-polynomial-complete"],"display":"Polynomial Complete","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-polynomial]]","[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","[[93-df-boolalg]]","[[93-fact-boolean-2]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-fact-polynomial-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-fact-polynomial-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Polynomial Complete"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f40774d4e625146e\" href=\"?note=f40774d4e625146e\" title=\"93-df-polynomial\">93-df-polynomial</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7087f500cc845c3b\" href=\"?note=7087f500cc845c3b\" title=\"93-df-boolean-algebra\">93-df-boolean-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"757a95a2c335d9fb\" href=\"?note=757a95a2c335d9fb\" title=\"93-df-boolalg\">93-df-boolalg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e2431dc0f64e0f95\" href=\"?note=e2431dc0f64e0f95\" title=\"93-fact-boolean-2\">93-fact-boolean-2</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"fact-polynomial-complete-—-Polynomial-Complete\">fact-polynomial-complete — Polynomial Complete</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span> is the Boolean similarity type and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2\">\\(\\mathbf2\\)</span> is the indexed-operation two-element algebra defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e2431dc0f64e0f95\" href=\"?note=e2431dc0f64e0f95\" title=\"93-fact-boolean-2\">93-fact-boolean-2</a>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathbf2|=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(|\\mathbf2|=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pol}_n(\\mathbf2;\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})\">\\(\\mathrm{Pol}_n(\\mathbf2;\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})\\)</span> is its set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-ary polynomial operations as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f40774d4e625146e\" href=\"?note=f40774d4e625146e\" title=\"93-df-polynomial\">93-df-polynomial</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Pol}_n(\\mathbf2;\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})=(\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Pol}_n(\\mathbf2;\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})=(\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Functional completeness here follows from disjunctive normal form and\nthe availability of constants.  It does not characterize the\ntwo-element Boolean algebra among all finite algebras.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"fact-polynomial-complete-—-Polynomial-Complete","text":"fact-polynomial-complete — Polynomial Complete","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"f40774d4e625146e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-polynomial]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"7087f500cc845c3b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolalg","status":"resolved","id":"757a95a2c335d9fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-boolalg]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-fact-boolean-2","status":"resolved","id":"e2431dc0f64e0f95","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-fact-boolean-2]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-fact-boolean-2","status":"resolved","id":"e2431dc0f64e0f95","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}$ is the Boolean similarity type and $\\mathbf2$ is the indexed-operation two-element algebra defined in [[93-fact-boolean-2]], with $|\\mathbf2|=\\{0,1\\}$.","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"f40774d4e625146e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Pol}_n(\\mathbf2;\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})$ is its set of $n$-ary polynomial operations as in [[93-df-polynomial]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf2","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathbf2|=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pol}_n(\\mathbf2;\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Pol}_n(\\mathbf2;\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})=(\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}).","display":true}],"bytes":1043,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["f40774d4e625146e","7087f500cc845c3b","757a95a2c335d9fb","e2431dc0f64e0f95"]}